{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/fe9a588e1006d2d8d2d2d8cec4e2b379.webp?t=1772266460\" width=309 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features <strong>18 playable characters</strong>. Select 6 to form an expedition squad and embark on a journey to vanquish the source of evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the 18 characters possesses unique combat styles. Strategically assemble your squad to balance offense and sustainability, significantly reducing expedition difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/4c150446095921fad163dcd3ef620d04.poster.avif?t=1772266460\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/4c150446095921fad163dcd3ef620d04.webm?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/4c150446095921fad163dcd3ef620d04.mp4?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy\u00a0Nimble Cat to <strong>steal equipment</strong> from enemies using her theft ability, ensuring your squad fights with abundant resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/eed7cbd64800263628b06d83fc1be48d.poster.avif?t=1772266460\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/eed7cbd64800263628b06d83fc1be48d.webm?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/eed7cbd64800263628b06d83fc1be48d.mp4?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Loongstrike Fighter can trigger consecutive pursuits with base-attacks, unleashing a barrage of continuous strikes upon enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/05d073d86d876805d6d62c90faceed62.poster.avif?t=1772266460\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/05d073d86d876805d6d62c90faceed62.webm?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/05d073d86d876805d6d62c90faceed62.mp4?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aegis of Gold shields allies with wings of protection, sharing damage taken and dramatically boosting squad survivability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/7c6f0df035ba3b628c72ee0b5d0e2128.poster.avif?t=1772266460\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/7c6f0df035ba3b628c72ee0b5d0e2128.webm?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/7c6f0df035ba3b628c72ee0b5d0e2128.mp4?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/b360495cf44cd0694a016f11cde1e691.webp?t=1772266460\" width=309 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in turn-based tactical combat across maps with <strong>elevation differences</strong>. Control key areas using terrain height advantage to eliminate enemies efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/1fd7a47412a8cbc0fe2e8caf2cba42ce.poster.avif?t=1772266460\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/1fd7a47412a8cbc0fe2e8caf2cba42ce.webm?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/1fd7a47412a8cbc0fe2e8caf2cba42ce.mp4?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entering strongholds from different directions on the route map generates varied starting positions. <strong>Approaching from the rear</strong> may grant tactical advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/ab5e04af1e421066ac0e9d3694440c68.poster.avif?t=1772266460\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/ab5e04af1e421066ac0e9d3694440c68.webm?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/ab5e04af1e421066ac0e9d3694440c68.mp4?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical cards spawn at specific battlefield locations during combat. Acquiring and strategically deploying these cards can secure decisive victory or enable dramatic reversals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/688d4fe358577f87b73adc50547148ef.poster.avif?t=1772266460\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/688d4fe358577f87b73adc50547148ef.webm?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/688d4fe358577f87b73adc50547148ef.mp4?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 unique combat boards featuring grasslands, wastelands, deserts, oases, towns, forests, tundras, snow peaks, and ruins. Procedurally generated routes ensure distinct expedition experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/72ec977d225fe955ee5c1e50b340552e.webp?t=1772266460\" width=309 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neutral units\u2014Oversight Committee members\u2014appear alongside allies and enemies. At battle start, they issue challenge tasks. Completion grants <strong>battlefield buff</strong> selections lasting <strong>until battle end</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/b860a81f38f6a862492121e387215388.poster.avif?t=1772266460\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/b860a81f38f6a862492121e387215388.webm?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/b860a81f38f6a862492121e387215388.mp4?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeated challenge completion yields additional equipment and items from the Committee based on achievement count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/0a2d2c8ed73523663cb75cdcbc380f45.webp?t=1772266460\" width=309 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Post-combat Crystals appear for each expedition member, containing core mechanic enhancements. Choose wisely to significantly empower characters for subsequent journeys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/2b0c5696b976adb369776f12ea2a5ec8.poster.avif?t=1772266460\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/2b0c5696b976adb369776f12ea2a5ec8.webm?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/2b0c5696b976adb369776f12ea2a5ec8.mp4?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeated enemies drop equipment. Each character has 3 equipment slots for customizable builds, providing stats, passive skills, and <strong>additional combat skills</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/c91934af5a6035a29e08be3ae8e50196.poster.avif?t=1772266460\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/c91934af5a6035a29e08be3ae8e50196.webm?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/c91934af5a6035a29e08be3ae8e50196.mp4?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters possess unique Skill Board. Spend AP to permanently unlock abilities granting base stat improvements and <strong>new combat skills</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/df514411da20e92314ce19d1ce81f689.poster.avif?t=1772266460\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/df514411da20e92314ce19d1ce81f689.webm?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/df514411da20e92314ce19d1ce81f689.mp4?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/bcb180c4294394f8afc4000f497ced46.webp?t=1772266460\" width=309 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic points on the route map offer recovery, resurrection, shops, and other functions. Utilize them methodically for tactical supremacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/fb4a8d4a9f45d7d6f4858a88ed617c44.poster.avif?t=1772266460\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/fb4a8d4a9f45d7d6f4858a88ed617c44.webm?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/fb4a8d4a9f45d7d6f4858a88ed617c44.mp4?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events may spawn post-combat. Arriving expedition teams can trigger diverse effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/f01a6cd7faad955b37daeeb68541aa0b.poster.avif?t=1772266460\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/f01a6cd7faad955b37daeeb68541aa0b.webm?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/f01a6cd7faad955b37daeeb68541aa0b.mp4?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/136c992a5d624585c6cf4cceae3baf65.webp?t=1772266460\" width=309 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlocking sufficient Skill Board nodes unlocks <strong>customizable board</strong>. Use special items to tailor skill unlocks, enabling personalized character progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing an expedition, enable Enhanced Mode for new runs. Enemies scale with character progression, while post-battle AP rewards increase and deployable unit cap <strong>rises by 1</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfilling hidden conditions before expedition completion unlocks <strong>special stages</strong> featuring unique combat challenges. Clues may appear in in-game text.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3800870?t=1772266460","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3800870?t=1772266460","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/f7be0c33804be71adc87fafc69a43817df17e552/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772266460","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/f7be0c33804be71adc87fafc69a43817df17e552/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772266460","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4142770,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/fe9a588e1006d2d8d2d2d8cec4e2b379.webp?t=1772266460\" width=309 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features <strong>18 playable characters</strong>. Select 6 to form an expedition squad and embark on a journey to vanquish the source of evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the 18 characters possesses unique combat styles. Strategically assemble your squad to balance offense and sustainability, significantly reducing expedition difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/4c150446095921fad163dcd3ef620d04.poster.avif?t=1772266460\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/4c150446095921fad163dcd3ef620d04.webm?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/4c150446095921fad163dcd3ef620d04.mp4?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy\u00a0Nimble Cat to <strong>steal equipment</strong> from enemies using her theft ability, ensuring your squad fights with abundant resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/eed7cbd64800263628b06d83fc1be48d.poster.avif?t=1772266460\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/eed7cbd64800263628b06d83fc1be48d.webm?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/eed7cbd64800263628b06d83fc1be48d.mp4?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Loongstrike Fighter can trigger consecutive pursuits with base-attacks, unleashing a barrage of continuous strikes upon enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/05d073d86d876805d6d62c90faceed62.poster.avif?t=1772266460\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/05d073d86d876805d6d62c90faceed62.webm?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/05d073d86d876805d6d62c90faceed62.mp4?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aegis of Gold shields allies with wings of protection, sharing damage taken and dramatically boosting squad survivability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/7c6f0df035ba3b628c72ee0b5d0e2128.poster.avif?t=1772266460\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/7c6f0df035ba3b628c72ee0b5d0e2128.webm?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/7c6f0df035ba3b628c72ee0b5d0e2128.mp4?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/b360495cf44cd0694a016f11cde1e691.webp?t=1772266460\" width=309 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in turn-based tactical combat across maps with <strong>elevation differences</strong>. Control key areas using terrain height advantage to eliminate enemies efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/1fd7a47412a8cbc0fe2e8caf2cba42ce.poster.avif?t=1772266460\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/1fd7a47412a8cbc0fe2e8caf2cba42ce.webm?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/1fd7a47412a8cbc0fe2e8caf2cba42ce.mp4?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entering strongholds from different directions on the route map generates varied starting positions. <strong>Approaching from the rear</strong> may grant tactical advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/ab5e04af1e421066ac0e9d3694440c68.poster.avif?t=1772266460\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/ab5e04af1e421066ac0e9d3694440c68.webm?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/ab5e04af1e421066ac0e9d3694440c68.mp4?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical cards spawn at specific battlefield locations during combat. Acquiring and strategically deploying these cards can secure decisive victory or enable dramatic reversals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/688d4fe358577f87b73adc50547148ef.poster.avif?t=1772266460\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/688d4fe358577f87b73adc50547148ef.webm?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/688d4fe358577f87b73adc50547148ef.mp4?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 unique combat boards featuring grasslands, wastelands, deserts, oases, towns, forests, tundras, snow peaks, and ruins. Procedurally generated routes ensure distinct expedition experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/72ec977d225fe955ee5c1e50b340552e.webp?t=1772266460\" width=309 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neutral units\u2014Oversight Committee members\u2014appear alongside allies and enemies. At battle start, they issue challenge tasks. Completion grants <strong>battlefield buff</strong> selections lasting <strong>until battle end</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/b860a81f38f6a862492121e387215388.poster.avif?t=1772266460\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/b860a81f38f6a862492121e387215388.webm?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/b860a81f38f6a862492121e387215388.mp4?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeated challenge completion yields additional equipment and items from the Committee based on achievement count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/0a2d2c8ed73523663cb75cdcbc380f45.webp?t=1772266460\" width=309 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Post-combat Crystals appear for each expedition member, containing core mechanic enhancements. Choose wisely to significantly empower characters for subsequent journeys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/2b0c5696b976adb369776f12ea2a5ec8.poster.avif?t=1772266460\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/2b0c5696b976adb369776f12ea2a5ec8.webm?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/2b0c5696b976adb369776f12ea2a5ec8.mp4?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeated enemies drop equipment. Each character has 3 equipment slots for customizable builds, providing stats, passive skills, and <strong>additional combat skills</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/c91934af5a6035a29e08be3ae8e50196.poster.avif?t=1772266460\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/c91934af5a6035a29e08be3ae8e50196.webm?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/c91934af5a6035a29e08be3ae8e50196.mp4?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters possess unique Skill Board. Spend AP to permanently unlock abilities granting base stat improvements and <strong>new combat skills</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/df514411da20e92314ce19d1ce81f689.poster.avif?t=1772266460\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/df514411da20e92314ce19d1ce81f689.webm?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/df514411da20e92314ce19d1ce81f689.mp4?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/bcb180c4294394f8afc4000f497ced46.webp?t=1772266460\" width=309 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic points on the route map offer recovery, resurrection, shops, and other functions. Utilize them methodically for tactical supremacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/fb4a8d4a9f45d7d6f4858a88ed617c44.poster.avif?t=1772266460\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/fb4a8d4a9f45d7d6f4858a88ed617c44.webm?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/fb4a8d4a9f45d7d6f4858a88ed617c44.mp4?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events may spawn post-combat. Arriving expedition teams can trigger diverse effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/f01a6cd7faad955b37daeeb68541aa0b.poster.avif?t=1772266460\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/f01a6cd7faad955b37daeeb68541aa0b.webm?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/f01a6cd7faad955b37daeeb68541aa0b.mp4?t=1772266460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/extras/136c992a5d624585c6cf4cceae3baf65.webp?t=1772266460\" width=309 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlocking sufficient Skill Board nodes unlocks <strong>customizable board</strong>. Use special items to tailor skill unlocks, enabling personalized character progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing an expedition, enable Enhanced Mode for new runs. Enemies scale with character progression, while post-battle AP rewards increase and deployable unit cap <strong>rises by 1</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfilling hidden conditions before expedition completion unlocks <strong>special stages</strong> featuring unique combat challenges. Clues may appear in in-game text.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["LD Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800870/1cc26fbb048f768c6816b4bfea2ee848b47a56b9/header.jpg?t=1772266460","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i3-8100 / AMD Ryzen\u2122 3 2300X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA\u00ae GeForce\u00ae GTX 1050 / AMD Radeon\u2122 RX 460<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen\u2122 5 2500X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA\u00ae GeForce\u00ae GTX 1060 / AMD Radeon\u2122 RX 570<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3800870/1650233974/5aa745c1779fc97bbbbd0c02f02a0e9eb67a919c/1764424106/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764426037","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3800870/1650233974/5aa745c1779fc97bbbbd0c02f02a0e9eb67a919c/1764424106/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764426037","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3800870/1650233974/5aa745c1779fc97bbbbd0c02f02a0e9eb67a919c/1764424106/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764426037","id":257240451,"name":"Gameplay Video","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257240451/6e1e27432e13663e27c13c18f0786e3b80685fbe/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764426037"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3800870/1000981811/561ba008a746c0828f97525c60f838f87b481e8e/1757668041/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758247214","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3800870/1000981811/561ba008a746c0828f97525c60f838f87b481e8e/1757668041/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758247214","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3800870/1000981811/561ba008a746c0828f97525c60f838f87b481e8e/1757668041/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758247214","id":257196673,"name":"\u5723\u8f89\u6218\u8bb0-\u9884\u544a\u7247","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257196673/8a6b23a397b08b9b0e981029e596cf3221c5335f/movie_6